Error [E0209]: Implicit clone of `held`
  --> unmarked_take_keeps_mark_for_cleanup_generic_and_capture.jet:19:14
    |
 19 |     hand_off(held)
    |              ^^^^
 Why: `hand_off` expects to take ownership of this value
 Fix: Write the move marker `^` (`^held`) if this is the last use, or copy first with `held.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0209
